# RETIRED TOMBSTONE - DO NOT INSTALL.
#
# The former NOPASSWD rule let any vq-admins member select a Git commit whose
# build backend root would execute. Restricting the command path did not make
# the caller-selected source trustworthy. deploy-multi-user.sh removes any
# installed /etc/sudoers.d/vq-multi-user-refresh fragment. Operators now use
# ordinary authenticated sudo with a full SHA accepted by the fleet release.
#
# This file intentionally contains no sudoers rule.
